  "details": "In the new SteamVR skeletal release, hand tracking can be controlled in VRChat with gestures. This is great for when you're using optical hand tracking, however not so much when using gloves.\n\nThis issue predominantly occurs on UDCap gloves, so may be hard to re-create until other devices of this nature release and ship; however these controls do not get disable when using Steam input only.\n\nThis causes resting hand positions to cause undesired locomotion movements, predominantly when hands are by your side.\n\nA toggle to disable this input and to only listen to Steam input would solve this",
